3. **Gate updates through verifier**:
   Σ_{t+1} = Σ~_{t+1} if 𝒱(Σ~_{t+1}) = 1, else Σ_t
   - Verifier checks: functional correctness, tool permission boundaries, robustness to random state perturbations.
